{"id":"14053f662182bedf","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-set-closure-under-operation.md","title":"ZFC Set Closure Under Operation","display":"df-zfc-set-closure-under-operation — ZFC Set Closure Under Operation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set-closure-under-operation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set-closure-under-operation"],"display":"df-zfc-set-closure-under-operation — ZFC Set Closure Under Operation","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-rel-domain.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-rel-range.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set-closure-under-operation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set-closure-under-operation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set-closure-under-operation — ZFC Set Closure Under Operation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97c28eede56ea5e4\" href=\"?note=97c28eede56ea5e4\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-rel-domain.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-rel-domain.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9a8f01bfcbcdc014\" href=\"?note=9a8f01bfcbcdc014\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-rel-range.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-rel-range.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,F,n\\in V\">\\(A,F,n\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\operatorname{dom}(F),\\operatorname{ran}(F))\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\operatorname{dom}(F),\\operatorname{ran}(F))\\)</span> (function predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSetClosureUnderOperation}_S(A,F,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSetClosureUnderOperation}_S(A,F,n)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set\\text{-}closure\\text{-}under\\text{-}operation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetClosureUnderOperation}_S(A,F,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\operatorname{dom}(F),\\operatorname{ran}(F))\\land A^n\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(F)\\land\\forall s\\in A^n\\;(F(s)\\in A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set\\text{-}closure\\text{-}under\\text{-}operation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetClosureUnderOperation}_S(A,F,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\operatorname{dom}(F),\\operatorname{ran}(F))\\land A^n\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(F)\\land\\forall s\\in A^n\\;(F(s)\\in A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Closure is relative to a fixed finite arity <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>. Replacing the former condition <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\subseteq A\">\\(s\\subseteq A\\)</span> by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in A^n\">\\(s\\in A^n\\)</span> distinguishes argument tuples from arbitrary subsets and requires the operation to be defined on every such tuple.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor"